    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31024" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰκοστός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>twentieth</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.34
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				Ep.
			 also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐεικοστός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					24.765
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰκοστή, ἡ</span>, <i>a tax of a twentieth</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ. τῶν γιγνομένων, τῶν κατὰ
			θάλασσαν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.54
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ. ἐλευθερίας</span> or -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιῶν</span>, = Lat. <i>vicesima
				manumissionum,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				3.1446
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				96.8
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
